          }
        ],
        "text": "(Poomaalai finishes drinking coffee. Gundumani runs in carrying a newspaper.)",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s087-u002",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "குண்டுமணி",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s087-d001",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 105,
            "printedPage": 97
          }
        ],
        "text": "Amma! Amma! Did you see this! Your younger brother has put out an advertisement asking for Kumudha-amma's address!",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s087-u003",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பூமாலை",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s087-d002",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 105,
            "printedPage": 97
          }
        ],
        "text": "Ah! (She looks at the newspaper.) Paranthaman is searching for Kumudha—the sinner! Some danger is going to come to her too! Gundumani, I must leave for Madras immediately.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s087-u004",
